[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0010","text":"呐～，圆香前辈～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0020","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0030","text":"去国外的话想去哪里～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0040","text":"什么啊，突然"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0050","text":"在填杂志的问卷～\n想去的地方太多了，选不出来～这样想着～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0060","text":"选不出来的话，直接那样写不就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0070","text":"……\n也是呢～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0080","text":"啊，圆香前辈没有吗～？\n国外想去的地方～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0090","text":"……那些家伙不在的国家"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0100","text":"那些家伙是指虫子～？\n我觉得不会有那种国家啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
